# Only the backtesting workspace and the root README are versioned.
# The market data (~11 GB), the FYERS download helpers and local scratch
# directories all stay on disk and out of git. See README.md for the layout
# a working copy is expected to have.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/backtesting/

# Python build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Run logs: regenerated on every backtest, ~13 MB across 67 files
*.log

# Raw grid sweeps: 67 MB of two files, regenerable from heads-tails scripts.
# Their _summary.md and the smaller trades CSVs are still tracked.
backtesting/results/heads-tails/heads_tails_nifty_grid_long_daywise.csv
backtesting/results/heads-tails/heads_tails_nifty_grid_daywise.csv
